{"version":1,"content":"<p>「這是一場百年一遇的洪水。」幾個月前，庫克（Tim Cook）這樣形容AI數據中心引發的內存漲價潮。如今，接班的特納斯（John Ternus）交出了上任後的第一份財報，形勢很清晰：庫克所説的洪水淹了整個手機行業，蘋果靠漲價暫時站在了岸上，但水位還在上漲。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584880.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T14:01:25.923449+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T13:45:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T13:58:21.528940+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T13:58:21.528940+00:00","content_hash":"7b15778a07256cec609bd53bf5b01fb8c19375ed5dbb360fc372d6c3ea597193","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}